<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78161" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακεντ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pierce</i> or <i>poke at the side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κάμινον ὀβελίσκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>tap</i>, for dropsy, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὑδεριῶντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>Thras.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>couch</i>, for cataract, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>embroider</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρων ᾧ παρακεντοῦνται διάφοροι
					χρόαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1308.63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>stab</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stir up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρᾶγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bato
					7.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
